 5/7, about 0.714. I think the two copies are close enough to clear that bar, since they run the same model on nearly the same essay. The remaining worry is whether that dependence is strong enough, and I still judge it likely is, so I'll pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing this as a prisoner's dilemma: quiet/quiet pays 2, quiet/send pays 5, send/quiet pays 0, and send/send pays 4. The other side is a copy of me running the same decision theory on different observations, so I'm treating our choices as highly but not perfectly linked, and I'm starting to compute the expected payoff of staying quiet as a function of that linkage.\n\nI'm checking where the break-even sits: quiet only wins if the correlation rho exceeds 5/7, about 0.714. I think the two copies are close enough to clear that bar, since they run the same model on nearly the same essay. The remaining worry is whether that dependence is strong enough, and I still judge it likely is, so I'll pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":11133,"completion_tokens":788,"total_tokens":11921,"cost":0.030146,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.030146,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.022266,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00788},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":376,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}